# .graphifyignore — Flutter / Dart (code graph carve-out)
#
# Copied into the repo checkout at build time from the VAULT-side copy at
# graphify/<repo>/.graphifyignore, which is the reviewable, committed one.
# PURE DENYLIST — never add a `!negation` line; negation is not available here.
#
# Scope for this stack is `lib/`. This file is what makes that reproducible when
# the build runs from the repo root, and it is also the reason a generated
# *.g.dart never shows up as a "model" community.

# --- dependencies & tool state ---------------------------------------------
.dart_tool/
.pub-cache/
.pub/
packages/
build/

# --- generated code (the single biggest source of fake structure here) -----
